## Portfolio Overview

This portfolio focuses on the implementation, query processing, and optimization of the Apex Digital Bank database system using Microsoft SQL Server. The database was developed from the Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD) and relational schema produced in Portfolio 1.

The portfolio demonstrates database implementation, data population, query execution, execution plan analysis, indexing techniques, and performance optimization. These activities illustrate how relational databases can efficiently support modern digital banking operations while maintaining scalability, consistency, and reliability.

